OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FMark Forrest showcases the best
OL,7,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,8,     Fbeyond, including a live concert
OL,9,     Ffrom the BBC National Orchestra of
OL,10,     FWales and highlights from the
OL,11,     FCowbridge Festival.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Stan Tracey
OL,13,     F5/5. Kate Molleson is joined by
OL,14,     FClark Tracey to explore the life
OL,15,     Fand work of his father, pianist
OL,16,     Fand composer Stan Tracey, who kept
OL,17,     Fperforming and composing until the
OL,18,     Fend.
OL,19,G1700 In Tune
OL,20,     FLive flamenco guitar from Samuel
OL,21,     FMoore. Hugh Cutting and Frederick
OL,22,     FWaxman on Orfeo ed Euridice.
